ent-MopItem = 拖把 | mop
    .desc = 一把勢不可擋的拖把，內臟清理任務正等著你。 | A mop that can't be stopped, viscera cleanup detail awaits.
ent-SolutionMopSmall = { ent-SolutionMop }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionMop.desc }
ent-SolutionMopNormal = { ent-SolutionMop }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionMop.desc }
ent-SolutionMopLarge = { ent-SolutionMop }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionMop.desc }
ent-AdvMopItem = 進階拖把 | advanced mop
    .desc = 這款電動拖把配備更大的儲水槽，能快速將內部試劑替換為清水。不包含「自動小丑防禦系統」。 | Motorized mop that has a bigger reservoir and quickly replaces reagents inside with water. Automatic Clown Countermeasure not included.
ent-WetFloorSign = 「地面濕滑」標誌 | wet floor sign
    .desc = 請注意！地板濕滑！ | Caution! Wet Floor!
ent-WetFloorSignMineExplosive = { ent-WetFloorSign }
    .desc = { ent-WetFloorSign.desc }
    .suffix = Explosive
ent-Plunger = 活塞 | plunger
    .desc = 一個配有紅色塑膠吸盤和木製手柄的通馬桶器。用於疏通排水管。 | A plunger with a red plastic suction-cup and a wooden handle. Used to unclog drains.
ent-GoldenPlunger = 金色活塞 | golden plunger
    .desc = 一個吸盤上塗有一層薄薄的金箔、由塑膠製成的通馬桶器，作為對多年服務的感謝禮。至今仍被用來疏通排水管。 | A plunger with a plastic suction cup coated in a thin layer of gold given as a token of appreciation for years of service. Still used to unclog drains.
ent-RagItem = 濕抹布 | damp rag
    .desc = 大概是用來清理髒亂的吧。 | For cleaning up messes, you suppose.
ent-WireBrush = 鋼絲刷 | wire brush
    .desc = 一款刷毛粗硬的鋼絲刷，即使是最頑固的鏽斑也能輕鬆刮除。 | A bristly steel wire brush, perfect for scraping away even the toughest patches of rust.
ent-WireBrushElectrical = 電線刷 | electrical wire brush
    .desc = 一款刷毛粗硬的鋼絲刷，配備可活動刷頭，讓清潔工作變得輕鬆許多。 | A bristly steel wire brush with a moving head, allowing for a way easier time cleaning.
